3.Edit the pubspec.yaml file in your insta_clone project to add the google_fonts package as a dependency. 
Run flutter pub get to install it, and verify that google_fonts appears in your project’s .packages or pubspec.lock file.

Add google_fonts:-

Open:
insta_clone/pubspec.yaml

Find dependencies: and add google_fonts:

dependencies:
  flutter:
    sdk: flutter
  google_fonts: ^6.2.1

Then run:flutter pub get

Verify
Open:
insta_clone/pubspec.lock

Search for:
google_fonts
